 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\n株式会社山田製作所\n中央区銀座4-5-6, 104-0061 東京都, Japan\n登録番号: TO199116400319\n\nMASTER SERVICES\nAGREEMENT\n\n発行元\n株式会社山田製作所\n中央区銀座4-5-6\n104-0061 東京都\nJapan\nVAT: TO199116400319\n\n請求先\n株式会社山田製作所\n中央区銀座4-5-6\n104-0061 東京都\nJapan\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 2026年02月02日 (the \"Effective Date\") by and\nbetween 株式会社山田製作所, with its registered office at 中央区銀座4-5-6, 東京都 (\"Party A\"), and 株式会社山田製作所, with its\nregistered office at 中央区銀座4-5-6, 東京都 (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 12 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in\naccordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the\npurposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of Switzerland.\n\nSignatures\nParty A    株式会社山田製作所 / 鈴木花子\nParty B    株式会社山田製作所 / 田中太郎\nDate       2026年02月02日",
